          "id": "548e5dd8cd7fe9d4df248863b1826391de457c70",
          "message": "fix(mise): prevent host mise.toml from breaking version resolution (#627)\n\n* feat: add .miserc.toml to gitignore and document local dev environment\n\n- Ignore .miserc.toml to prevent accidental commits of local environment configurations.\n- Update documentation to include the new workflow for loading development tools via mise.\n\nGenerated-by: aiautocommit\n\n* chore: lock mise.toml environment versioning\n\nGenerated-by: aiautocommit\n\n* fix(mise): prevent host config pollution by setting working directory\n\n* Set the working directory for mise commands to the cache directory.\n* Ensures that mise does not accidentally discover and apply local configuration files (like locked=true) from the host filesystem during operation.\n\nGenerated-by: aiautocommit\n\n* docs(mise): add comment explaining cacheDir purpose\n\nGenerated-by: aiautocommit",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-14T12:41:00-06:00",
