          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d813265ed815468ef8602fd016ac9dbafe438520",
          "message": "feat: add linux shell environment task and jq dependency (#639)\n\n- introduce a new Linux-based shell orchestration task for container machines to facilitate development and debugging across environments.\n- add `jq` to the project's development tools to support the new shell script's reliance on JSON parsing for network inspection.\n- implement robust Docker TCP proxying via `socat` to allow the Linux guest machine to interface seamlessly with the host's Docker daemon.\n\nGenerated-by: aiautocommit",
