          "message": "refactor(node): avoid duplicate detection log messages (#649)\n\n* refactor(node): remove duplicate log messages in Nx package resolution\n\nGenerated-by: aiautocommit\n\n* refactor(node): prevent duplicate custom start log messages\n\n- Move the custom start command log message from `isSPA` to `Plan` so it runs once during provider planning rather than during SPA checks.\n- Add log message for Nx app resolution in the build step.\n\nGenerated-by: aiautocommit",
